{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超出席一個以粵港澳大灣區為主題的論壇，提及今日在香港揭幕的APEC財政部長會。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n李家超表示，特區政府會把握財長會的機會，介紹香港作為大灣區中心城市，聯繫國家機遇和國際機遇的疊加優勢。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:23:56.674172+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:38:06.286981+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:09.707241+00:00","content_hash":"35ebd033a6ed9dbf282b541e9d597087ffceec307aa8c43833cdf318859957c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}